<title>UK: Den Danske sets 75 mln stg step-up FRN.</title>
<headline>Den Danske sets 75 mln stg step-up FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue</p>
<p>was announced by sole lead manager Salomon Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEN DANSKE BANK</p>
<p> AMT    75 MLN STG    SPREAD  *  37.5 BP   MATURITY ** 22.JUL.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    22.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A2	  ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   79 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    NONE</p>
<p> NOTES    * TO 22.JUL.04, 187.5 BP THEREAFTER</p>
<p>	   ** CALL AT PAR ON 22.JUL.04</p>
<p>		FUNGIBLE WITH 125 MLN STG FRN LAUNCHED IN JUNE</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    25 BP     SELL CONC  54 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	FREE TO TRADE IMMEDIATELY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
